      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُؤْمَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Glue, with which a thing is stuck:</i> (S:)
accord. to the K, [following A'Obeyd, (see art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">روم</span>,)] it is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُومَةٌ</span> only, without <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span>: but Th mentions
it with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span> also; and both are correct. (MF, TA.)

